    {
      "id": "88ee873249e15d2b92b2031712a59b90341c33df",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 658574642,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> epan/dissectors/packet-btmesh.c:5070:44: error: unused parameter ‘value’ \\[-Werror=unused-parameter\\] format_tai_to_utc_date(gchar \\*buf, guint64 value) {\n\nSounds like a compiler bug to me:\n\n```\nstatic void\nformat_tai_to_utc_date(gchar *buf, guint64 value) {\n\n    if (value == 0 ) {\n        g_snprintf(buf, ITEM_LABEL_LENGTH, \"Unknown\");\n    } else {\n        gchar *time_str;\n        time_t val;\n\n        // Leap seconds removal\n        guint64 delta = 0;\n        // TAI epoch is 2000-01-01T00:00:00 TAI\n        guint64 leap_seconds[] = {\n            189388800, // 1 January 2006, 00:00:00, seconds from TAI epoch\n            284083200, // 1 January 2009, 00:00:00, seconds from TAI epoch\n            394416000, // 1 July 2012, 00:00:00, seconds from TAI epoch\n            489024000, // 1 July 2015, 00:00:00, seconds from TAI epoch\n            536544000, // 1 January 2017, 00:00:00, seconds from TAI epoch\n        };\n        for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n            if (value >= leap_seconds[i]) {\n                delta++;\n            } else {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n\n\t...\n}\n```\n\nDoesn't look unused to me.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-08-24T06:14:53.173Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-08-24T06:14:53.173Z",
